    "arcadeLocalizationTargets": "ContinuousIntegrationBuild changes UpdateXlfOnBuild (true for local developer builds; false by default for CI). The translation target remains enabled in either case.",
    "xliffTargets": "The unchanged task/targets generated thirteen translated .resx files in every mode. Missing culture recognition occurs later in the actual bootstrap SDK resource pipeline.",
    "msbuildCultureCache": "The pinned NET branch checks CultureInfo.GetCultureInfo(name, predefinedOnly:true); the non-NET branch uses an enumerated culture cache.",
    "counterfactual": "Changing only stock ICU data restores all thirteen actual satellite DLLs and culture directories with either CI value; CI false/true full-data outputs have identical paths, sizes and SHA256 values.",
    "boundedConclusion": "Request icu-data-full=78.1-r0 in the original native build-image package closure and add a pre-build localization readiness probe. A new full producer run and all existing admission/consumer gates remain required.",
    "ciFlagConclusion": "These controls do not support adding --ci as a workaround for the missing culture directories."
  },
